  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's walk through the dialogue. A passerby tries to revive Samsonov from his freezing stupor.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "neighbor",
   "t": "Эй, Ваня, вставай, вставай!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hey, Vanya, get up, get up!' A passing neighbor shakes Ivan by the shoulder to rouse him from the snowy bench.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "neighbor",
   "t": "Давай, вставай, замёрзнешь на снегу!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Come on, get up, you'll freeze in the snow!' Sleeping outdoors in a Russian winter is a quick way to freeze to death.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Вставай, страна огромная...",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Arise, vast country...' Ivan groggily mutters the opening line of the famous World War II anthem 'The Sacred War'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "neighbor",
   "t": "Какая страна? Вставай на ноги!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What country? Get on your feet!' The neighbour urges him to stand up before someone calls the police.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Страна огромная...",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'A vast country...' Ivan repeats the lyrics like a broken record in his half-conscious state.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "neighbor",
   "t": "Ты всю ночь тут проспал!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You slept here all night!' The neighbor cannot believe Ivan spent the entire freezing night out on that bench.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Где я? Который час?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Where am I? What time is it?' Ivan slowly opens his bloodshot eyes and looks around the courtyard.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "neighbor",
   "t": "Уже утро, люди идут мимо.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It's already morning, people are walking past.' The neighbour points out neighbours heading to work.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Лёха! Где мой друг Лёха?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Lyokha! Where is my friend Lyokha?' Ivan remembers someone he promised something to.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "neighbor",
   "t": "Дома спит твой друг.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Your friend is sleeping at home.' The neighbour tells him that everyone else is warm inside.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
